      "source": "This method allows the application of a function to this <a href=\"CriteriaDefinition.Predicate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition.Predicate</code></a> value. The function should expect a\nsingle <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> argument and produce an <code>R</code> result. Any exception thrown by f() will be propagated to\nthe caller.",
      "translation": "该方法允许将函数应用于此<a href=\"CriteriaDefinition.Predicate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition.Predicate</code></a>值。该函数应接受单个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a>参数，并产生一个<code>R</code>结果。由 f() 抛出的任何异常都将传播给调用者。",
      "count": 1
    },
